{"4078230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parcel Delivery Simulator", "steam_appid": 4078230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Delivery Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of logistics and delivery! In this immersive simulation game, you start as a rookie employee at a courier company until your boss suddenly leaves town and hands you the reins. Now, it's your turn to build a delivery empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take control of daily operations: deliver packages across the city, sign lucrative contracts, and grow your headquarters from a modest office to a bustling logistics hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees, assign tasks, and optimize your workforce to keep deliveries running smoothly. Every decision counts. Will you be a hands-on manager or a strategic mastermind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Fleet</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in new vehicles to boost efficiency and reach. From nimble scooters to heavy-duty trucks, choose the right tools for the job and keep your fleet in top shape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate the City</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install parcel lockers in strategic locations, streamline delivery routes, and outpace the competition. Your goal? To create the most spectacular courier company the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of tycoon games or just love the thrill of building something from scratch, this game offers a rich, rewarding experience full of strategic depth and creative freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Delivery Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of logistics and delivery! In this immersive simulation game, you start as a rookie employee at a courier company until your boss suddenly leaves town and hands you the reins. Now, it's your turn to build a delivery empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b8c3eb22aa6431e96fcfaa54fd4d9f46.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take control of daily operations: deliver packages across the city, sign lucrative contracts, and grow your headquarters from a modest office to a bustling logistics hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/8a9c89d69f1a078ac7f1767a4cc9824e.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire skilled employees, assign tasks, and optimize your workforce to keep deliveries running smoothly. Every decision counts. Will you be a hands-on manager or a strategic mastermind?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/742e5765cf4912d75dcb59b16e9f803d.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Fleet</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in new vehicles to boost efficiency and reach. From nimble scooters to heavy-duty trucks, choose the right tools for the job and keep your fleet in top shape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/b5dd09365461b3e682ef0fff50b9e164.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate the City</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install parcel lockers in strategic locations, streamline delivery routes, and outpace the competition. Your goal? To create the most spectacular courier company the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of tycoon games or just love the thrill of building something from scratch, this game offers a rich, rewarding experience full of strategic depth and creative freedom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.poster.avif?t=1786624349\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.webm?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/extras/5e3dbf37b631a73bfd9bb70e6062ba47.mp4?t=1786624349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You've landed a job at a courier company, but your boss has to leave town. Now you're the boss. Deliver packages, sign new contracts, expand your office, buy new vehicles. Hire employees, set up parcel lockers around town, and create the most profitable courier company in the world. Simulation game.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Slovak, Arabic", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/7ffb52194bf760056b8f30a680027ec442aa90de/header.jpg?t=1786624349", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/cda59e83020efdb689df23cf91f041e2bbeff8f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786624349", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078230/cda59e83020efdb689df23cf91f041e2bbeff8f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786624349", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 / i3-13100T, AMD A10 6800K / Athlon X4 950<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 660 2GB / GTX 1050 2GB, AMD Radeon R7 265 2GB / RX 460 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p 60fps</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-14100, AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia RTX 3050 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 6400 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\